@startuml
!include ../includes/attestify-theme.puml
title Current Run State And Atomic Transitions
[*] --> Absent
Absent --> Collecting : successful Start
Collecting --> Collecting : Evidence add/replace
Collecting --> Collecting : readiness rejection
Collecting --> Completed : successful Verify + atomic commit
Completed --> Completed : immutable
Completed --> Collecting : successful new Start selects new directory
